request bare v1 "Bare request"
description "A request with no scenario (fictional rules): `run` has nothing to run, and `vectors` nothing to make vectors from"

use organization org from "../../examples/shared/company.ringi"
use calendar office from "../../examples/shared/office.cal"

form
  what : text "What"  count >=1 <=100

route
  first  board

who
  board = team board

every stage
  due in 3 business days at end of day
  when late expire
  when empty stay

ticket
  self approval  not allowed
